{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人葉璇年初開始染指內地短劇市場，而且長拍長有，近日台前幕後開拍新一季，邀來賈曉晨及張國強助陣，葉璇笑言希望發展成處境劇系列。</p><p>而視后江美儀不介意「自降身價」，首次加入拍攝短劇，與新生代演員打成一遍，獲讚親民貼地。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.909875+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.242019+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.242019+00:00","content_hash":"b25b6b86d509228f5fb1e90b0448d338eff1c61c29323caf91a4122680abb2b6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}